{"id":"n89820-2-7","stage":1,"title":"아주머니 · 大嫂","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89820-2-7-1","ko":"엄마, 웬 떡이 있어요?","zh":"妈妈，怎么有年糕？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}},{"text":"떡이","meaning":"糕，糕饼，糕点","explanation":"떡：糕，糕饼，糕点；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"떡","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20199","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떡이","audio":"/audio/b6e6c31171fdd26732d5.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"f7ea97e270cc40ef","term":"떡","zh":"糕，糕饼，糕点","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3","entryId":"20199","definition":"类似于打糕、松糕，将谷物磨成的粉蒸熟或煮熟后制成的食物。","pronunciation":["떡"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audi